        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Kandih mun gai aniu khou puangmei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih mungai aniu khou puangmei,",
            "Tigan lou o jing pui bam khou hei;",
            "Jingmei ruina achang man the,",
            "Jaujian lapui bam Jordan pang khou hei.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He! ata nduang lou o,",
            "Rianrapui ram jingmei khou hei;",
            "Ata nduang lou o, Immanuel Guangh Jisu.",
            "",
            "2. Kandih khou lik kandiu Guangh Jisu,",
            "Njianloumei nang lat gaimei hei;",
            "Nangjan nthanmei thuanku khang,",
            "Tingnik thui tithai o, kalvari lat.",
            "",
            "3. Jianmei nun tam bampui bam kandih hei,",
            "Kapma huai bam e kanloumei pu;",
            "Thukmei jei rui kanloumei guai,",
            "tingsang mun gai neilahna guang dat ro.",
            "",
            "4. Guang jisu ganphiu gan gaimeipu,",
            "Gan guang dat ro alung jing khou hei;",
            "Jingpui kandih khou bam mei guai,",
            "Ganlou dat na nang rui jailou datro."
          ]
        }
      },
